  "researchNotes": "Official jomalone.com collection pages and /products.json (on jomalone.co.uk) returned HTTP 403 in every attempt, so no official notes were read and noteSource is reported for all entries. Range taken from the authorised retailer listing scento.com/brands/jo-malone-london (14 products, read in full) plus 7 colognes whose names and notes were in WebSearch results from Harrods and Selfridges (the pages themselves returned 403); those 7 come from search result text only. Harrods, Selfridges and lookfantastic pages blocked. Only 100 ml colognes or the cologne product lines are included; decants, gift sets, candles, body care and minis skipped. Perfumers stated only where the page says so. Country and years are not stated on the pages read, except 2026 release statements on Sea Salt & Bergamot. Concentration on scento pages is often absent: Hinoki & Cedarwood, Myrrh & Tonka, Red Hibiscus, Scarlet Poppy Intense and Velvet Rose & Oud keep concentration null. Notes not separated into tiers on some pages (flat used). The full JO MALONE range is larger than the 21 entries here; limited-edition and archive items beyond the retailer listing were not covered.",
